cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ThermoFuzzy-PID in research, cite this software and cite the
  original 2021 undergraduate thesis when referring to its reported results.
type: software
title: 'ThermoFuzzy-PID: Adaptive Fuzzy-PID Thermal Control for Burn-In Chambers'
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python and MATLAB code for adaptive Fuzzy-PID control of burn-in
  chambers, including synthetic sensor data, system identification, robustness
  benchmarks, experimental optimization, and Simulink model generation.
authors:
  - family-names: Cordeiro
    given-names: Matheus Gomes
repository-code: 'https://github.com/fobos123deimos/Fuzzy-Burn-in'
version: 0.1.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - fuzzy PID
  - burn-in chamber
  - thermal control
  - system identification
  - MATLAB
  - Simulink
  - Python
